      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Man I hope this request get some upvotes someday and this get added into VRChat. The current way of allowing objects to rotate is so unnecessarily hard and very unprecise.\n\nAllowing physbones to rotate with hand would give us the ability to create avatar pickup items and such a bunch of cool things",
