  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-11-19T04:44:13.372Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "You can currently grab and pull/push physbones, but there's no simple way to rotate/pivot the grabbed bone. I dont think this should be a unilateral thing, but would rather be a component tickbox in the SDK. this would optionally allow users more granular control over the grabbed physbone, where appropriate.",
